summary:
  The empty download folder field names a folder the downloads never go to.

history:
  The hint was the literal ~/Music/OnAir while the downloads went to the
  desktop's own music folder, which a Finnish desktop calls Musiikki. The
  hint and the download road ask PathLogic.defaultDir now; this writes the
  old guess back into the field.

target:
  package/contents/ui/config/configAppearance.qml

find:
                return PathLogic.shownDir(PathLogic.defaultDir(music, home + "/Music"), home)

replace:
                return "~/Music/OnAir"

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_folder_hint_names_the_folder_the_downloads_go_to.
  Line-neutral.
